OL,3,AImmigration agents search Congresswoman
OL,4,AIlhan Omar's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FOmar was born in Somalia and came to
OL,7,Fthe US aged eight fleeing war. First
OL,8,Felected to Congress in 2018, she is
OL,9,Frunning for reelection next month, and
OL,10,Fis an outspoken critic of President
OL,11,FDonald Trump.
